{
    "title": "MGM Rewards",
    "description": "Make the perfect vacation getaway with the MGM Rewards App\u2014the official app of MGM Resorts! Explore, book and manage dining, shows, concerts, immersive experiences, hotel reservations and more, at exciting MGM Resorts destinations across the Las Vegas Strip and nationwide. \r\n\r\nThe MGM Rewards App lets you:\r\n\u2022\tBook your dream escape \u2013 Search and book the lowest hotel rates at all MGM Resorts destinations.\r\n\u2022\tStart your stay the easy way \u2013 MGM Rewards members can check in 24 hours before arrival, and when it\u2019s time to leave, simply skip the front desk and check out in just a few clicks.\r\n\u2022\tUse a Digital Key \u2013 Get instant access to your room right from your smartphone.\r\n\u2022\tUpgrade your stay \u2013 Treat yourself with an easy room upgrade.  \r\n\u2022\tCheck your MGM Rewards progress \u2013 View all your MGM Rewards account details with ease. \r\n\u2022\tPlan your trip \u2013 Use the \u201cTrips Tab\u201d to plan your visit to any MGM Resorts destination.\r\n\u2022\tMake dining reservations \u2013 Use our intuitive search filters to find the perfect restaurant.\r\n\u2022\tBook electrifying entertainment \u2013 Buy tickets anytime to an unbeatable entertainment lineup, from \u201cO\u201d by Cirque du Soleil\u00ae to Brad Garrett\u2019s Comedy Club to mind-blowing concerts, adrenaline-filled hockey, basketball and other exhilarating sports, immersive experiences such as Shark Reef Aquarium, PLAY Playground, and so much more!\r\n\u2022\tChat with us 24/7 \u2013 Have questions or need assistance during your stay?  Ask our Digital Concierge for help anytime.\r\n\r\nPut a world of renowned luxury and entertainment in your pocket. \r\n\r\nThe MGM Rewards App is your ultimate companion for unforgettable travel experiences at all of our exciting MGM Resorts destinations, including: \r\n\r\nLas Vegas:\r\n \r\nBellagio\r\nARIA\r\nVdara\r\nThe Cosmopolitan of Las Vegas\r\nMGM Grand\r\nThe Signature at MGM Grand\r\nMandalay Bay\r\nDelano Las Vegas\r\nPark MGM\r\nNoMad Las Vegas\r\nNew York-New York\r\nLuxor\r\nExcalibur\r\n\r\nOther popular destinations: \r\n\r\nBeau Rivage (Biloxi, MS)\r\nBorgata (Atlantic City, NJ)\r\nEmpire City Casino (Yonkers, NY)\r\nMGM Grand Detroit (Detroit, MI)\r\nMGM National Harbor (Oxen Hill, MD)\r\nMGM Northfield Park (Northfield, OH)\r\nMGM Springfield (Springfield, MA)\r\n\r\nElevate your travel experience and streamline your journey from start to finish with the MGM Rewards App! \r\n\r\n*Must be 21 years or older to check-in to MGM hotels, to join the MGM Rewards loyalty program, and to gamble in Las Vegas, Nevada (and other jurisdictions). Use of digital key subject to ID verification requirements. To receive room-ready push notifications as part of the mobile check-in process, you must opt-in to receive push notifications on your mobile device. If Location Services are enabled, we will prioritize assigning you an available room, and recommend dining options nearby. Availability of mobile app features may vary by property. Subject to Mobile App Terms of Use, Digital Key Terms of Use, and Privacy Policy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make the perfect vacation getaway with the MGM Rewards App\u2014the official app of MGM Resorts! Explore, book and manage dining, shows, concerts, immersive experiences, hotel reservations and more, at exciting MGM Resorts destinations across the Las Vegas Strip and nationwide. <br><br>The MGM Rewards App lets you:<br>\u2022\tBook your dream escape \u2013 Search and book the lowest hotel rates at all MGM Resorts destinations.<br>\u2022\tStart your stay the easy way \u2013 MGM Rewards members can check in 24 hours before arrival, and when it\u2019s time to leave, simply skip the front desk and check out in just a few clicks.<br>\u2022\tUse a Digital Key \u2013 Get instant access to your room right from your smartphone.<br>\u2022\tUpgrade your stay \u2013 Treat yourself with an easy room upgrade.  <br>\u2022\tCheck your MGM Rewards progress \u2013 View all your MGM Rewards account details with ease. <br>\u2022\tPlan your trip \u2013 Use the \u201cTrips Tab\u201d to plan your visit to any MGM Resorts destination.<br>\u2022\tMake dining reservations \u2013 Use our intuitive search filters to find the perfect restaurant.<br>\u2022\tBook electrifying entertainment \u2013 Buy tickets anytime to an unbeatable entertainment lineup, from \u201cO\u201d by Cirque du Soleil\u00ae to Brad Garrett\u2019s Comedy Club to mind-blowing concerts, adrenaline-filled hockey, basketball and other exhilarating sports, immersive experiences such as Shark Reef Aquarium, PLAY Playground, and so much more!<br>\u2022\tChat with us 24/7 \u2013 Have questions or need assistance during your stay?  Ask our Digital Concierge for help anytime.<br><br>Put a world of renowned luxury and entertainment in your pocket. <br><br>The MGM Rewards App is your ultimate companion for unforgettable travel experiences at all of our exciting MGM Resorts destinations, including: <br><br>Las Vegas:<br> <br>Bellagio<br>ARIA<br>Vdara<br>The Cosmopolitan of Las Vegas<br>MGM Grand<br>The Signature at MGM Grand<br>Mandalay Bay<br>Delano Las Vegas<br>Park MGM<br>NoMad Las Vegas<br>New York-New York<br>Luxor<br>Excalibur<br><br>Other popular destinations: <br><br>Beau Rivage (Biloxi, MS)<br>Borgata (Atlantic City, NJ)<br>Empire City Casino (Yonkers, NY)<br>MGM Grand Detroit (Detroit, MI)<br>MGM National Harbor (Oxen Hill, MD)<br>MGM Northfield Park (Northfield, OH)<br>MGM Springfield (Springfield, MA)<br><br>Elevate your travel experience and streamline your journey from start to finish with the MGM Rewards App! <br><br>*Must be 21 years or older to check-in to MGM hotels, to join the MGM Rewards loyalty program, and to gamble in Las Vegas, Nevada (and other jurisdictions). Use of digital key subject to ID verification requirements. To receive room-ready push notifications as part of the mobile check-in process, you must opt-in to receive push notifications on your mobile device. If Location Services are enabled, we will prioritize assigning you an available room, and recommend dining options nearby. Availability of mobile app features may vary by property. Subject to Mobile App Terms of Use, Digital Key Terms of Use, and Privacy Policy.",
